&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; margin-bottom: 18px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
